. *---------------------------------------------------------------------------
. * foreign_ownership_pct = share of the firm's capital held by foreign owners (0-100 %)
. * fdi_10_flag           = 1 if that share is 10% or more
. * export_flag, import_flag = exports / imports reported (1 yes, 0 no; export often unknown)
